  "title": "Distributed Key-Value Store",
  "difficulty": "Hard",
  "summary": "Design a DynamoDB-style key-value store: partitioned, replicated, and fast for both reads and writes.",
  "scenario": [
    "Internal teams want a simple get/put store that scales without them thinking about servers.",
    "It must survive losing a node, and a single hot key or a spike of writes must not take it down."
